# Deccan Birders — Environment Variables
#
# No secrets are needed for this application.
#
# The subsidised gateway URL and Swarm ID iframe origin are public
# configuration values, not credentials. They are safe to hardcode.
#
# SWARM_GATEWAY_URL=https://api.gateway.ethswarm.org/
# SWARM_ID_IFRAME_ORIGIN=https://swarm-id.snaha.net
